From: logix727 <logix727@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 18:44:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] SystemUI: hold max refresh for UDFPS overlay

[metroid/evo] Rebased onto lineage-23.2. Upstream split show() into an overload
pair, so the requestMaxRefreshRate() guard now goes in
show(params, attachListener) -- the one that actually holds the body -- rather
than the 1-arg delegate. The property declarations moved with the surrounding
context. Everything else applied unchanged.

Original patch was authored as "Your Name <your.email@example.com>"; kept the
logix727 identity used by the rest of the series.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RTyThMzCkh5fd3Ct1JP62p
